# Optional. Everything works keyless without it.
#
# Set ADMIN_KEY to gate the admin endpoints (list/delete agents, read/change
# settings): clients then pass `Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_KEY>` (or
# x-admin-key: <ADMIN_KEY>). With it unset, those endpoints stay open —
# fine for a personal deployment, not for a public one.
ADMIN_KEY=
